  'Zelensky said that in the week since Trump announced an energy ceasefire Russia had deliberately struck Ukraine\'s energy and oil and gas sector 76 times; overnight alone substations in Vinnytsia, Zhytomyr, Khmelnytskyi and Odesa regions were hit, leaving tens of thousands of families without power.',
  'Kyiv Independent notes that Trump has so far avoided confronting Putin over the violations while pressing Ukraine to stop strikes on Russia; DW and Meduza carry Zelensky\'s statement.'])

